# Committed on purpose. `graft build` writes this file, and it is what keeps
# graft's cards greppable: ripgrep reads .ignore BEFORE .gitignore, so the
# `!graft/` below re-admits the tree to SEARCH while `/graft/` in .gitignore
# still keeps it out of COMMITS. Without it, `rg` goes blind to the index.
# The .cache and .graph lines stay excluded - they are noisy machine state.
!graft/
graft/.cache/
graft/.graph/
